Artwork

The MIT License above covers Commit Walk's code and documentation. It does not
cover its artwork, which is Copyright (c) 2026 Lucia Nazzaro, all rights
reserved:

- the logos: assets/commit-walk-logo.svg and assets/commit-walk-logo-outlined.svg
- the keyboard picture: assets/keyboard.svg
- the sunflower and commit-line drawings in hooks/welcome.ts (COMMIT_LINE,
  LARGE, MEDIUM, SMALL_LINE and SMALL, with their colours)

Commit Walk shows the drawings when it runs, and copies and forks of this
repository may keep the artwork, unchanged, as part of Commit Walk. Any other
use of the artwork, or a changed version of it, needs Lucia Nazzaro's
permission.

Third-party work in this repository is under its own licence; see
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
